      "writtenOn": "2023-03-22T16:58:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my mind, the JNI thread is already not a UI thread.\n\nIf you can test your change, you should be able to put a sleep(10 sec) in the cb and check if you have a UI freeze / Application Not Responding error when you hit the sleep\n\nBut I am not saying this with a lot of confidence",
